  "description": "Picktea is an elegant modern display typeface designed to bring sophistication and quiet luxury into your creative projects. This modern serif font works beautifully for logos, fashion branding, magazine headlines, beauty packaging, and premium design layouts. With refined curves and balanced proportions, Picktea creates a graceful typographic presence that enhances both digital and print design.",
